@startuml
title Agent Messaging Communication Activity Diagram

start

if (Choose communication type) then (unicast)
elseif (Choose communication type) then (multicast)
else (broadcast)
endif
if (Choose message encryption) then (encrypted)
:Provide encryption;
else (not encrypted)
endif
:Send unicast message to another agent;
:Another agent receives message;
if (Another agent receives message) then (encrypted)
:Decrypt message;
else (not encrypted)
endif
:Send multicast message to the group;
:Other agents in the group receive message;
if (Other agents in the group receive message) then (multicast group join/leave notification)
:Send notify to join/leave multicast group;
else (multicast data delivery complete)
:Send broadcast message to everyone in the same local network;
:Other agent in the same local network receive message;
endif
stop

@enduml